From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rogue: VKDBG force 4-core multicore report (experiment)

ICD 判决实验：ioctl shim 解码显示 Connect（BVNC 正确）与 GetMultiCoreInfo
（NumCores=1, eError=OK）全部成功后 ICD 仍 Disconnect。BXM-4-64 为 4 核
GPU，ICD 支持表疑似要求多核拓扑——强制 NumCores=4 + 合成 caps（核 0 用
HW 读数，1-3 用 COMPUTE 合成），验证 ICD 是否因此放行。仅诊断用。

Signed-off-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/devices/rogue/rgxmulticore.c | 22 ++++++++++++++--
--- a/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/devices/rogue/rgxmulticore.c
+++ b/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/devices/rogue/rgxmulticore.c
@@ -200,6 +200,9 @@
 #endif
 		{
 			ui32NumCores = OSReadHWReg32(psDevInfo->pvRegsBaseKM, RGX_CR_MULTICORE_SYSTEM);
+			/* VK-DBG: 实验性——HW 读到 %u 核，强制按 BXM-4-64 的 4 核上报 */
+			PVR_LOG(("VKDBG: MULTICORE_SYSTEM reg=%u", ui32NumCores));
+			ui32NumCores = 4;
 		}
 #if !defined(NO_HARDWARE)
 		/* check that the number of cores reported is in-bounds */
@@ -254,8 +257,17 @@
 					ui32MulticoreRegOffset = RGX_CR_MULTICORE_GPU;
 				}
 
-				psDevInfo->pui64MultiCoreCapabilities[i] =
-							OSReadHWReg64(pvCoreRegBase, ui32MulticoreRegOffset) & RGX_CR_MULTICORE_GPU_MASKFULL;
+				if (i == 0)
+				{
+					psDevInfo->pui64MultiCoreCapabilities[i] =
+						OSReadHWReg64(pvCoreRegBase, ui32MulticoreRegOffset) & RGX_CR_MULTICORE_GPU_MASKFULL;
+					PVR_LOG(("VKDBG: caps[0]=0x%llx", (unsigned long long)psDevInfo->pui64MultiCoreCapabilities[0]));
+				}
+				else
+				{
+					psDevInfo->pui64MultiCoreCapabilities[i] =
+						(i | RGX_MULTICORE_CAPABILITY_COMPUTE_EN);
+				}
 
 				if (!bMulticoreRegsMapped)
 				{
